1
00:00:00,087 --> 00:00:03,984
Cleopatra lived closer to the Moon
landing than to the building of the Great

2
00:00:03,984 --> 00:00:04,440
Pyramid.

3
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:08,240
The pyramid at Giza was
finished around 2560 BC.

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:11,724
Cleopatra was born
about 2,500 years later.

5
00:00:12,111 --> 00:00:15,768
To her, the pyramids were already
more ancient than she is to us.

6
00:00:16,188 --> 00:00:18,046
From Cleopatra to Neil Armstrong?

7
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:19,620
Only about 2,000 years.

8
00:00:20,007 --> 00:00:21,050
It gets stranger.

9
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:25,098
Woolly mammoths were still alive on a
remote Arctic island while the pyramids were

10
00:00:25,098 --> 00:00:25,488
rising.

11
00:00:25,875 --> 00:00:30,228
And Oxford was already teaching students
before the Aztec capital was even founded.

12
00:00:30,626 --> 00:00:32,267
History is not a neat line.

13
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:33,343
It overlaps.

14
00:00:33,343 --> 00:00:34,248
Follow for more.
